   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Illustrious artist styles (artist LoRA + style slot + artist tags)\n\nStarter workflow from **Comfortable** (Workflows screen). Every model it uses was installed with it.\n\n1. Write Danbooru tags in the positive prompt; the artist's trigger words (obari_style, retro artstyle) are already in.\n2. Press Run: base image, 1.5x hires pass through 2x-AnimeSharpV4, then the face detailer.\n3. Make it yours: swap the Artist LoRA for any 'This artist' LoRA (Ayami Kojima, Tsutomu Nihei, Jim Lee, Norman Rockwell, Adam Hughes...), turn on the Style LoRA slot with Ctrl+B (sumi-e ink here; Art Nouveau, Lineart, CPS II pixel art, Marvel Rivals also fit), keep both around 0.6-0.8, and add 1-2 artist tags like (wlop:0.8).\n\n**Models:** WAI-illustrious v17, Masami Obari LoRA, Zen Ink Wash Sumi-e LoRA, 2x-AnimeSharpV4, face detector kit\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Illustrious NSFW anime with hires fix and face detailer\n\nStarter workflow from **Comfortable** (Workflows screen). Every model it uses was installed with it.\n\n1. Write Danbooru tags in the positive prompt (quality tags are already there). Add an artist tag, or select the **LoRA slot** and press **Ctrl+B** to turn it on, then pick any LoRA from *Suggested by AI → This artist*.\n2. Press **Run**: base image (832x1216), 1.5x hires pass through 2x-AnimeSharpV4, then the face detailer.\n3. For explicit detail add the NSFW detector kit and a second detailer pass.\n\n**Models:** WAI-illustrious-SDXL v17, 2x-AnimeSharpV4, face detector (Impact Subpack)\n**Settings:** Euler a, 25 steps, CFG 6 (hires 20 steps, denoise 0.4)"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
